            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/update",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mobile",
                "partner",
                "update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/update**\n\n**Auth:** Bearer `{{token}}`\n**Body:** `multipart/form-data` (do not set Content-Type manually)\n\n### Before sending\n1. **Location** → States → Cities → Areas → Pincodes\n2. **Login** (or Register)\n3. While pending: disable `partner_services` and `bank_account` (or clear values)\n4. After approval (`verification_status` = 2): run **Catalog**, then enable catalog + bank fields\n5. Select files: `image`, `aadhar_card` (and optional other verification files)\n\n| Section | Fields |\n|---------|--------|\n| Profile / location | gender, experience, state_id, city_id, area_id, pincode, address, image, name, email, phone_number, date_of_birth, device_token, password, confirm_password |\n| Services (approved) | partner_services |\n| Banks (approved) | bank_account |\n| Documents | aadhar_card, pan_card, driving_license, vehicle_registration, police_verification_certificate |\n\n`partner_documents` JSON is not supported."
